[{"title":"得弟书","author":"胡奎","text":"一度书来一寄衣，千回书到不如归。\n湖南芦雁知兄弟，水远山长作队飞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57020,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"失鹤","author":"胡奎","text":"鍊得丹砂顶渐红，养来驯狎不须笼。\n桐阴立转三更月，尚想声回碧落风。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57021,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题扇示俞生","author":"胡奎","text":"荷叶圆时初见汝，木犀落后便相疏。\n秋声只在庭前树，分寸阴中好看书。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57022,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠道士","author":"胡奎","text":"一曲瑶笙鹤背风，仙衣初剪绛霞红。\n碧桃花落春如海，归到天坛月正中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57023,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"荷露","author":"胡奎","text":"池上风荷碧玉盘，朝来承得露华寒。\n也知此物同欹器，早把明珠著眼看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57024,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"竹风","author":"胡奎","text":"一夜金声与玉声，钧天九奏本分明。\n何当截作昭华琯，吹作虞廷彩凤鸣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57025,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过甫里祠","author":"胡奎","text":"秋水初生射鸭阑，寺前红叶树斑斑。\n洞庭吹散朝来雨，放出船头一半山。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57026,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过太湖","author":"胡奎","text":"鸱夷湖上水如空，十幅蒲帆得顺风。\n七十二鬟看不尽，捧心人在馆娃宫。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57027,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"月夜闻角送友人别","author":"胡奎","text":"月出城头海气凉，角声愁思两茫茫。\n故人又向明朝别，铁铸梅花亦断肠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57028,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"画鹰","author":"胡奎","text":"八月沙平海宇高，角鹰新解绿绒绦。\n曾从太华峰头见，万仞青云刷羽毛。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57029,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题太真鹦䳇图","author":"胡奎","text":"爱渠言语太分明，放出金笼更好听。\n立在阿环罗袖上，自弹圆舌念心经。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57030,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题雁","author":"胡奎","text":"云暗苍梧月影孤，一行归雁落寒芦。\n十年四海怀兄弟，忍向灯前看画图。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57031,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题望湖亭","author":"胡奎","text":"鸥外清波雁外山，望湖亭下系归船。\n夜深起坐占风信，龙在珠宫月在天。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57032,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题梅竹 其一","author":"胡奎","text":"姑射仙人冰雪姿，天寒翠袖立多时。\n分明一片黄昏月，照见贞心只自知。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57033,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题梅竹 其二","author":"胡奎","text":"我爱娟娟玉一枝，岁寒不改雪霜姿。\n如何也学春风面，定是今年醉日移。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57034,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"红竹","author":"胡奎","text":"蓬莱石上珊瑚树，曾见扶桑海水乾。\n相逐葛陂龙化去，何年服得九还丹。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57035,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"荷花鸂鶒图","author":"胡奎","text":"西子湖头荷叶圆，一双鸂鶒傍花眠。\n寄语采花湖上女，花边莫放木兰船。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57036,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"桃花画眉图","author":"胡奎","text":"人面花红照水时，春愁不遣别人知。\n山禽也学张京兆，试画朝来八字眉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57037,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"仙人醉归图","author":"胡奎","text":"金碧重重倚翠微，玉笙吹彻綵云飞。\n醉来不借瑶池鹤，却跨青鸾月下归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57038,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题柳塘野艇图 其一","author":"胡奎","text":"杨柳丝丝拂钓矶，野航一个倚斜晖。\n分明西塞山前见，只欠双双白鹭飞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57039,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题柳塘野艇图 其二","author":"胡奎","text":"雨后青山抹黛蛾，渔舟浑不怕风波。\n夕阳荡桨不归去，为爱溪南柳色多。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57040,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题海棠白头公十二红","author":"胡奎","text":"一枝斜倚短墙东，上有翩翩十二红。\n莫怪无情花里鸟，白头端的爱春风。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57041,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"太乙莲舟","author":"胡奎","text":"玉井芙蓉一叶秋，绛河清浅向西流。\n夜深自载青天月，不用吹灯阁上头。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57042,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题芙蓉图","author":"胡奎","text":"越王溪上秋风寒，浣花女儿渡江干。\n采得花中第一朵，恰似仙人掌上看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57043,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"洛妃图","author":"胡奎","text":"美人赠我双明珰，何以报之云锦裳。\n望断綵云招不得，临池为写十三行。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57044,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"罗浮美人图","author":"胡奎","text":"翠禽啼处玉娟娟，梦入梨云别有天。\n一夜清寒谁是伴，忽随明月到窗前。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57045,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"桃花双凫","author":"胡奎","text":"沙嘴春明刷羽衣，水流花落澹忘机。\n安知万里河梁别，一个南飞一北飞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57046,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"红梅","author":"胡奎","text":"西湖湖头第一花，不随凡卉媚韶华。\n自怜玉骨清如许，服得朝来一片霞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57047,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"日观葡萄","author":"胡奎","text":"上人爱书怀素草，人言画好书亦好。\n临池呼得墨龙归，万颗明珠落秋昊。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57048,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题黄子久画","author":"胡奎","text":"黄公学画如学仙，老兔夜浴箕筲泉。\n直欲移山超北海，不劳鍊石补青天。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57049,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"子美醉归图","author":"胡奎","text":"万里桥西一径斜，白头乱后得还家。\n经旬出饮向何处，黄四娘家看好花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57050,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"刘伶荷锸","author":"胡奎","text":"先生自是醉乡侯，傲睨乾坤隘九州。\n万古青山埋不得，生前只合葬糟丘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57051,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"吕望钓鱼","author":"胡奎","text":"白发萧萧老渭川，非熊梦入九重天。\n安知一片溪边石，钓得周家八百年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57052,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次咏轩雨夕见寄 其一","author":"胡奎","text":"巷北巷南才咫尺，一日不可废言诗。\n柴门谁道无供给，雪色荼縻半破时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57053,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次咏轩雨夕见寄 其二","author":"胡奎","text":"清閟阁中倪处士，硬黄茧纸旧题诗。\n恰似仙人掌中露，消得文园病渴时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57054,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秫庄许酒不至","author":"胡奎","text":"辛夷开遍又樱桃，不见山瓶寄浊醪。\n昨夜好风吹梦去，一溪春绿涨葡萄。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57055,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"得酒奉谢","author":"胡奎","text":"灵鹊声中午梦回，长须分送大瓶来。\n棠梨花畔呼鹦䳇，谁道閒愁洗不开。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57056,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄何尹 其一","author":"胡奎","text":"越人不识燕山雪，接得瑶花掌上看。\n不是烧丹句漏令，如何禁得许多寒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57057,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄何尹 其二","author":"胡奎","text":"蓟门六月寄书回，少女灯前信手开。\n料得书中无别事，离怀只是想归来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57058,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄何尹 其三","author":"胡奎","text":"秋风吹雁过滦河，橐载行车索价多。\n圣德如天无远近，江南江北思如何。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57059,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄何尹 其四","author":"胡奎","text":"年过富贵鬓斑斑，千里戎衣几日还。\n只有海门西畔月，秋风吹过雁门关。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57060,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄何尹 其五","author":"胡奎","text":"织得回文锦字书，临流寄与北溟鱼。\n平安定有明年信，楝子花开四月初。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57061,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄何尹 其六","author":"胡奎","text":"公馆萧条早放衙，牡丹今在别人家。\n子期去后知音少，犹有离弦寄伯牙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57062,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄何尹 其七","author":"胡奎","text":"十月芦沟雪正深，白狐一腋比千金。\n地椒野韭沙羊软，大瓮葡萄取次斟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57063,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄何尹 其八","author":"胡奎","text":"塞北悠悠望旆旌，南冠还识曼胡缨。\n题诗定作扬州梦，消受梅花一味清。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57064,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄何尹 其九","author":"胡奎","text":"中郎有女奏胡笳，北度单于万里沙。\n十八拍中无限思，定传新谱到天涯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57065,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄何尹 其十","author":"胡奎","text":"受降城外雨萧萧，闻说羌人款圣朝。\n李牧守边今第一，铙歌须制汉家谣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57066,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次咏轩雨夕见寄 其一","author":"胡奎","text":"古铜鸠杖能扶醉，小锦奚囊解贮诗。\n雨馆萧条形共影，一镫相待暮钟时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57067,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次咏轩雨夕见寄 其二","author":"胡奎","text":"种种愁来都是幻，堂堂春去可无诗。\n客中花事都狼籍，只有青松似旧时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57068,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闻潮","author":"胡奎","text":"孤城鼓角夕阳红，十日江南起飓风。\n倒挟潮声天上响，只疑床下是蛟宫。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57069,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"桃源图","author":"胡奎","text":"闻道仙源有路通，桃花万树自春风。\n楚人一炬咸阳火，不到金堂石室中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57070,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题明皇吹笛图","author":"胡奎","text":"天宝年中日正迟，沈香亭上看花时。\n梨园一曲新翻谱，白发宫中总不知。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57071,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题葡萄画扇","author":"胡奎","text":"越中老僧禅定馀，手撚百八摩尼珠。\n撒向虚空供明月，夜半惊落银蟾蜍。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57072,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"自遣 其一","author":"胡奎","text":"红颜养得看看老，白发梳来种种多。\n却喜算来无酒债，最难遣去是诗魔。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57073,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"自遣 其二","author":"胡奎","text":"二麦黄时气似秋，冬青花落雨才收。\n北窗暂假须臾睡，又听鹁鸠啼树头。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57074,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"自遣 其三","author":"胡奎","text":"落尽飞花满地红，无端三月雨声中。\n天心也与人心别，才见东风又北风。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57075,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"即事 其一","author":"胡奎","text":"不短不长莲漏点，乍寒乍暖麦秋时。\n病中正尔无消遣，閒看柴桑五字诗。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57076,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"即事 其二","author":"胡奎","text":"枇杷一树是谁栽，多谢邻翁送得来。\n不是王孙金弹子，山禽偷眼莫相猜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57077,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"即事 其三","author":"胡奎","text":"花艳妖娆偏怕雨，柳腰纤弱不禁寒。\n少年惯见无情思，何况如今病后看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57078,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"即事 其四","author":"胡奎","text":"馀寒犹殢越罗袍，一夜门前春水高。\n扶病强行庭树下，笑看山鸟啄樱桃。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57079,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"落梅风","author":"胡奎","text":"二十四番花信风，此风先到寿阳宫。\n若教吹入罗浮洞，笑杀江南白发翁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57080,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"惜花","author":"胡奎","text":"一片花辞旧日枝，随风飞去竟何之。\n莫教狼籍凝蛛网，愿托馀甘在蜜脾。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57081,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"感兴","author":"胡奎","text":"岁晚还家已暮春，看花少却二三人。\n城西宋老城南董，都作三生梦里身。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57082,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题东家牡丹","author":"胡奎","text":"晴风暖日地无埃，最大花头最晚开。\n留得旧时池馆在，也应花待我归来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57083,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寒食 其一","author":"胡奎","text":"七十四年归老日，一百五夜禁烟天。\n却笑山厨无热火，频将冷酒醉花前。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57084,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寒食 其二","author":"胡奎","text":"一百五日花候至，阿母坟前多白云。\n盖棺小弟犹未葬，泪洒松间斜日曛。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57085,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"辛夷花","author":"胡奎","text":"望春一树春前放，花样浑如紫兔毫。\n肯借题诗三百管，洛阳纸价又增高。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57086,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题白莲","author":"胡奎","text":"天然容色粉为腮，插向君家玉镜台。\n淡扫蛾眉看不厌，是谁收拾画中来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57087,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宋徽宗双鹊图","author":"胡奎","text":"一双灵鹊语楂楂，飞绕东阑一树花。\n朔雪南云天万里，不知传喜到谁家。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57088,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"纸鸢","author":"胡奎","text":"只凭一线上青天，中有天机合自然。\n莫待风高收不得，宫商别调不如前。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57089,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"暮春","author":"胡奎","text":"病里不知春去速，才逢寒食又清明。\n何人作伴共閒话，无酒无花慰此生。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57090,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"月下闻钟","author":"胡奎","text":"二千馀里故乡月，一百八声今夜钟。\n今夜故乡钟与月，天将声色付诗翁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57091,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"晚凉偶成","author":"胡奎","text":"馀霞淡淡夕阳西，碧树阴中一鸟啼。\n坐爱微凉无事恼，手持纨扇向人题。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57092,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄友","author":"胡奎","text":"楝花风落夏云初，日日临流望远途。\n三十六鳞江上鲤，如何不寄一行书。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57093,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"新凿池","author":"胡奎","text":"闻道宫中新凿池，多种芙蓉杨柳枝。\n近水芙蓉藏白鸟，当窗杨柳著黄鹂。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57094,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"忘忧花","author":"胡奎","text":"人言萱草可忘忧，忧不能忘已白头。\n若说此花能却老，不教慈母葬松楸。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57095,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"东园紫薇花","author":"胡奎","text":"旧时曾种紫薇花，五载归来感物华。\n石径升堂苔色满，曳裾坊口第三家。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57096,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"不出","author":"胡奎","text":"多时断酒不开尊，竟日看花懒出门。\n每有良朋来问讯，熏炉茶鼎略温存。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57097,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"病起 其一","author":"胡奎","text":"清晨病起怕临池，池水分明见鬓丝。\n水不照心空照影，瘦容勿遣外人知。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57098,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"病起 其二","author":"胡奎","text":"今晨试裹小乌巾，束带围宽略称身。\n东舍西邻走相慰，皆言林下一閒人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57099,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"晏眠","author":"胡奎","text":"金壶玉漏平分夜，绛蜡铜盘欲曙天。\n日出东方高丈五，更添丈五足高眠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57100,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}}]